infinite-patch 1
# Dark Ambient Abyssal Space Diffusion Delay FX
node 1 Notes Note Sequencer
  id notes
  pos 0 1024
  f rateBeats 0.25
  i steps 16
  i note0 48
  i note1 48
  i note2 60
  i note3 55
  i note4 48
  i note5 60
  i note6 53
  i note7 55
  i note8 48
  i note9 48
  i note10 60
  i note11 55
  i note12 48
  i note13 60
  i note14 53
  i note15 58
  b en0 1
  b en1 1
  b en2 1
  b en3 1
  b en4 1
  b en5 1
  b en6 1
  b en7 1
  b en8 1
  b en9 1
  b en10 1
  b en11 1
  b en12 1
